{"id":"wb-7-839","name":"北社三嵕庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"北社三嵕庙","text":"北社三嵕（zōng）庙，位于山西省长治市平顺县北社乡北社村，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n2004年6月10日，公布为山西省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位，是一座古建筑。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E7%A4%BE%E4%B8%89%E5%B5%95%E5%BA%99","revisionId":94366364,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94366364","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b26d97072d98bc500fa21ae5.jpg","title":"20260815_Beishe_Sanzong_Temple_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260815_Beishe_Sanzong_Temple_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/20260815_Beishe_Sanzong_Temple_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位 山西平顺 北社三嵕庙","width":320,"height":213}}